<p>The hymn the team plays next Sunday. Once through on the drive patch, open chords, <strong>no stopping whatever happens</strong>. Wrong chord, keep the time going, fix it on the next bar.</p>
<p>Listen for open strings ringing between chord changes. That is the muting problem inside a song, and it is the thing the congregation hears as “messy”.</p>
<p class="muted small">No metronome for this block. Sing it, or play along with a recording.</p>
